{"id":"2605.10922","authors":[{"_id":"6a029cddb823258e76123436","name":"Dong-Yang Li","hidden":false},{"_id":"6a029cddb823258e76123437","user":{"_id":"66054d519af76210c2ee4b8e","avatarUrl":"/avatars/c1854765b1e45ec33602b2cb9443f82a.svg","isPro":false,"fullname":"Wang Zhao","user":"thuzhaowang","type":"user","name":"thuzhaowang"},"name":"Wang Zhao","status":"claimed_verified","statusLastChangedAt":"2026-05-12T08:02:29.274Z","hidden":false},{"_id":"6a029cddb823258e76123438","name":"Yuxin Chen","hidden":false},{"_id":"6a029cddb823258e76123439","user":{"_id":"657a7458afbb0117ba15c59f","avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/657a7458afbb0117ba15c59f/8_iwTS1UG_mKnfylFbLsY.jpeg","isPro":false,"fullname":"Wenbo Hu","user":"wbhu-tc","type":"user","name":"wbhu-tc"},"name":"Wenbo Hu","status":"claimed_verified","statusLastChangedAt":"2026-09-22T08:45:05.296Z","hidden":false},{"_id":"6a029cddb823258e7612343a","name":"Meng-Hao Guo","hidden":false},{"_id":"6a029cddb823258e7612343b","name":"Fang-Lue Zhang","hidden":false},{"_id":"6a029cddb823258e7612343c","name":"Ying Shan","hidden":false},{"_id":"6a029cddb823258e7612343d","name":"Shi-Min Hu","hidden":false}],"mediaUrls":["https://cdn-uploads.huggingface.co/production/uploads/66054d519af76210c2ee4b8e/iWEfON8DsbfImkKGmNjlm.png"],"publishedAt":"2026-05-11T00:00:00.000Z","submittedOnDailyAt":"2026-05-12T00:00:00.000Z","title":"Pixal3D: Pixel-Aligned 3D Generation from Images","submittedOnDailyBy":{"_id":"66054d519af76210c2ee4b8e","avatarUrl":"/avatars/c1854765b1e45ec33602b2cb9443f82a.svg","isPro":false,"fullname":"Wang Zhao","user":"thuzhaowang","type":"user","name":"thuzhaowang"},"summary":"Recent advances in 3D generative models have rapidly improved image-to-3D synthesis quality, enabling higher-resolution geometry and more realistic appearance. Yet fidelity, which measures pixel-level faithfulness of the generated 3D asset to the input image, still remains a central bottleneck. We argue this stems from an implicit 2D-3D correspondence issue: most 3D-native generators synthesize shape in canonical space and inject image cues via attention, leaving pixel-to-3D associations ambiguous. To tackle this issue, we draw inspiration from 3D reconstruction and propose Pixal3D, a pixel-aligned 3D generation paradigm for high-fidelity 3D asset creation from images. Instead of generating in a canonical pose, Pixal3D directly generates 3D in a pixel-aligned way, consistent with the input view. To enable this, we introduce a pixel back-projection conditioning scheme that explicitly lifts multi-scale image features into a 3D feature volume, establishing direct pixel-to-3D correspondence without ambiguity. We show that Pixal3D is not only scalable and capable of producing high-quality 3D assets, but also substantially improves fidelity, approaching the fidelity level of reconstruction. Furthermore, Pixal3D naturally extends to multi-view generation by aggregating back-projected feature volumes across views. Finally, we show pixel-aligned generation benefits scene synthesis, and present a modular pipeline that produces high-fidelity, object-separated 3D scenes from images. Pixal3D for the first time demonstrates 3D-native pixel-aligned generation at scale, and provides a new inspiring way towards high-fidelity 3D generation of object or scene from single or multi-view images. Project page: https://ldyang694.github.io/projects/pixal3d/","upvotes":33,"discussionId":"6a029cdeb823258e7612343e","projectPage":"https://ldyang694.github.io/projects/pixal3d/","githubRepo":"https://github.com/TencentARC/Pixal3D","githubRepoAddedBy":"user","ai_summary":"Pixal3D introduces a pixel-aligned 3D generation approach that addresses fidelity issues in 3D asset creation by establishing direct pixel-to-3D correspondences through back-projection conditioning.","ai_keywords":["3D generative models","image-to-3D synthesis","fidelity","3D-native generators","canonical space","attention mechanisms","pixel-aligned generation","3D feature volume","back-projection conditioning","multi-view generation","scene synthesis"],"ai_summary_model":"Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-32B-Instruct","githubStars":2517,"organization":{"_id":"60e3f7f641ca131919975fe5","name":"TencentARC","fullname":"ARC Lab, Tencent","avatar":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/1625552871844-60e272ca6c78a8c122b12127.png"},"linkedModels":[{"author":"TencentARC","authorData":{"_id":"60e3f7f641ca131919975fe5","avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/1625552871844-60e272ca6c78a8c122b12127.png","fullname":"ARC Lab, Tencent","name":"TencentARC","type":"org","isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"followerCount":1113,"isUserFollowing":false},"downloads":0,"gated":false,"id":"TencentARC/Pixal3D","availableInferenceProviders":[],"lastModified":"2026-08-31T20:25:45.000Z","likes":381,"pipeline_tag":"image-to-3d","private":false,"repoType":"model","isLikedByUser":false},{"author":"Qtn-Cls","authorData":{"_id":"6a573f0f89d11a8fe53c611b","avatarUrl":"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6a573f0f89d11a8fe53c611b/4yN_DIoD7ahFRIVUWDG26.jpeg","fullname":"Quentin Colus","name":"Qtn-Cls","type":"user","isPro":false,"isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"followerCount":1,"isUserFollowing":false},"downloads":9427,"gated":false,"id":"Qtn-Cls/LocalMeshEngine","availableInferenceProviders":[],"lastModified":"2026-10-11T22:20:51.000Z","likes":8,"pipeline_tag":"image-to-3d","private":false,"repoType":"model","isLikedByUser":false},{"author":"mousebar01","authorData":{"_id":"6a85c329a44a4f6ee3427fb6","avatarUrl":"/avatars/223ae700161806737f9a64c36cac4b38.svg","fullname":"wedsf","name":"mousebar01","type":"user","isPro":false,"isHf":false,"isHfAdmin":false,"isMod":false,"isUserFollowing":false},"downloads":163,"gated":false,"id":"mousebar01/Pixal3D.cpp-GGUF","availableInferenceProviders":[],"lastModified":"2026-09-12T23:03:34.000Z","likes":4,"pipeline_tag":"ima